 "root_cause": "Media checked configuration only when starting. Configuration or credential authority could change while reading streams/downloading/processing or waiting for a final write, yet source registration or media artifact completion still committed using the old snapshot.",
 "changes": [
  "Capture authority and recheck it plus the current source binding at media stage boundaries",
  "Bind the existing Bilibili download before_dispatch callback so every retry rechecks authority",
  "Recheck source registration and media artifact completion inside the same database write transaction",
  "Gate frame object/image registration while retaining already completed object ownership and ordinary GC policy",
  "Keep exact revoked/changed codes and do not replay old work"
 ],
